<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="MoTuPerf.Desktop.ChangelogWindow"
        Title="更新日志"
        Width="700"
        SizeToContent="Height"
        MaxHeight="640"
        MinWidth="620"
        CanResize="False"
        WindowDecorations="BorderOnly"
        ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint="True"
        ExtendClientAreaTitleBarHeightHint="0"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner">
  <Border Classes="secondaryWindowFrame">
    <Grid RowDefinitions="48,*,58">
      <Border Grid.Row="0" Classes="dialogTitleBar" PointerPressed="DialogTitlePointerPressed">
        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,46">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="24,0,0,0">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8A5;" Foreground="{DynamicResource Theme.Accent}" FontSize="18" FontFamily="Segoe MDL2 Assets, sans-serif" Margin="0,0,10,0" />
            <TextBlock Text="更新日志" Classes="sectionTitle" />
          </StackPanel>
          <Button Grid.Column="1" Classes="windowButton closeButton" Content="&#x00D7;" Click="CloseWindow" ToolTip.Tip="关闭" />
        </Grid>
      </Border>
      <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
        <StackPanel Margin="22,10,18,12" Spacing="9">
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.24.3" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-18" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 精简设备选择页的检测状态，只保留跨平台总状态和 Android/iOS 简短提示，减少重复诊断文字对设备、应用和进程区域的挤压。&#x0A;• 新增“查看检测详情”二级弹框，完整保留本轮 Android/iOS 检测原因；苹果驱动下载/修复入口继续按实际检测结果显示。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.24.2" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-17" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 加强每轮采集的隔离与停止收尾，避免旧轮次的延迟回调影响当前数据；补充采集任务状态、中断原因、持续时长和指标最后更新时间的诊断记录。&#x0A;• 优化长时间采集的界面刷新、历史数据查找和曲线绘制，保留原始样本、峰谷、真实零值及缺测，不改变指标计算口径。&#x0A;• 完善 Android/iOS 设备检测提示，区分未授权、离线、组件异常、信任/锁屏、开发者模式和超时；部分信息读取失败时仍保留已发现设备。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <Border Classes="helpSection">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="v0.24.1" Classes="helpTitle" />
              <TextBlock Text="2026-09-16" Classes="dialogHint" />
              <TextBlock Classes="helpBody" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="• 收紧更新下载弹框，按内容适配高度，显示下载百分比并完整展示错误提示。&#x0A;• 设备选择框的确认按钮统一为主题主按钮样式。&#x0A;• 参数面板固定标题和实时/选中数据，仅指标列表滚动，底部保留与上方一致的空白。" />
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
      <Border Grid.Row="2" Classes="dialogFooter">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Spacing="8">
          <Button Classes="helpLinkButton" Content="查看完整在线更新日志" Click="OpenVersionLog" ToolTip.Tip="打开完整在线更新日志" />
          <Button Classes="primaryToolbarButton" Content="知道了" Click="CloseWindow" Width="104" Margin="0,0,18,0" />
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </Grid>
  </Border>
</Window>
